{%- comment -%}
  ═══ LBASS — HOMEPAGE "SHOP BY" BLOCK (2026-09-30; was the offer statement + collection links of 2026-08-26) ═══

  ONE BLOCK FOR EVERY WAY TO BROWSE. It replaces four homepage sections that
  each did part of this job:
    • the category mosaic (#catsGrid) — built in JavaScript (invisible to most
      LLM crawlers), dressed in editorial images that show no piece we sell,
      and counting SOLD pieces in its "N قطعة متوفرة" labels;
    • "shop by size" chips whose ?filter.v.option.size links have never been
      verified to filter on this store (see docs/ARCHITECTURE-AUDIT.md F1);
    • "shop by brand" chips, and the brand marquee that listed 27 brands of
      which 11 had no product in stock.
  The WHAT-WE-SELL text below (heading + Darija/English ledes) is kept as it
  was: it is the plain-HTML offer statement AI assistants read.

  WHY IT IS SERVER-RENDERED. Every link is in the HTML for every crawler and
  every visitor, with no JavaScript.

  EVERY TILE, CHIP AND COUNT IS IN-STOCK ONLY. A collection renders only when
  it holds at least one AVAILABLE product, and its number is that available
  count. The tile photo is the first available product's own photo — real
  stock, never a styled image. Measured 2026-08-26: the homepage used to link
  /collections/هوديات-و-سويت, which holds 0 products and returns a hard 404.

  WHAT IS DELIBERATELY NOT LINKED HERE
  - Football shirts: the shop has none (it has football BOOTS).
  - "Vintage" / "New arrivals" as tag URLs: /collections/all/<tag> is INERT
    on this store — measured, it returns every product whatever the tag.
  - brand-adidas / brand-nike: both 301 to adidas-originals / nike.
  - Size chips: re-add only after confirming in Search & Discovery that
    ?filter.v.option.size=M actually filters.

  PAGE POLARITY — MEASURED, DO NOT GUESS
  This page's legacy tokens are INVERTED at runtime (lbass-stamp): --ink is
  #FFFFFF, --cream is #0B0B0C and --gold is a dark red. This block states its
  colours literally. Never restyle it from token names.

  TRACKING: every link carries data-cro-event="home_collection_click" with the
  collection handle as label (unchanged from the previous version).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign hc_cats = 'صبابط@@صبابط · Sneakers||جاكيطات-و-معاطف@@جاكيطات · Jackets||سراويل-و-كارغو@@سراويل · Pants||track-pants@@Track Pants||تيشرتات-و-بولو@@تيشرتات · T-shirts||شورطات@@شورطات · Shorts||إكسسوارات@@إكسسوارات · Accessories' | split: '||'
  assign hc_brands = 'nike@@Nike||adidas-originals@@Adidas||brand-jordan@@Jordan||brand-new-balance@@New Balance||brand-vans@@Vans||brand-converse@@Converse||brand-karl-kani@@Karl Kani||brand-tommy-hilfiger@@Tommy Hilfiger||brand-zara@@Zara||brand-the-north-face@@The North Face||brand-asics@@ASICS||brand-levis@@Levi’s||brand-timberland@@Timberland||brand-hoka@@HOKA||brand-carhartt@@Carhartt||brand-money-clothing@@Money Clothing||one-of-one@@قطع 1/1||audited-drop-p001-p012@@الدروب الكامل' | split: '||'
-%}

{%- capture hc_tiles -%}
  {%- for pair in hc_cats -%}
    {%- assign bits = pair | split: '@@' -%}
    {%- assign col = collections[bits[0]] -%}
    {%- assign col_avail = col.products | where: 'available', true -%}
    {%- assign n = col_avail.size -%}
    {%- if n > 0 -%}
      {%- assign tile_p = col_avail | first -%}
      <li><a class="lbhc__cat" href="{{ col.url }}" data-cro-event="home_collection_click" data-cro-label="{{ bits[0] }}">
        <span class="lbhc__cat-img">{%- if tile_p.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ tile_p.featured_image | image_url: width: 320 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="320">{%- endif -%}</span>
        <span class="lbhc__cat-t">{{ bits[1] }}</span>
        <span class="lbhc__cat-n">{{ n }} قطعة متوفرة</span>
      </a></li>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture hc_chips -%}
  {%- for pair in hc_brands -%}
    {%- assign bits = pair | split: '@@' -%}
    {%- assign col = collections[bits[0]] -%}
    {%- assign n = col.products | where: 'available', true | size -%}
    {%- if n > 0 -%}
      <a class="lbhc__chip" href="{{ col.url }}" data-cro-event="home_collection_click" data-cro-label="{{ bits[0] }}">{{ bits[1] }}<span class="lbhc__n">{{ n }}</span></a>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- if hc_tiles != blank or hc_chips != blank -%}
<section class="lbhc" id="shop-by" aria-labelledby="lbhc-h">
  <style>
    /* dark-on-light — see PAGE POLARITY note above. Square corners: the
       lbass-stamp system is zero-radius everywhere else. */
    .lbhc{padding:clamp(36px,5vw,72px) var(--pad,20px);background:#FAF7F2;border-block:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.10)}
    .lbhc__in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
    .lbhc__kick{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#BF2E15;direction:ltr;text-align:end}
    .lbhc h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:clamp(20px,2.4vw,28px);line-height:1.35;color:#0B0B0C}
    /* Latin words inside Arabic lines: isolated (dir) and unbreakable, or RTL
       line-breaking splits "second-hand" at the hyphen and flips it. */
    .lbhc__lt{white-space:nowrap}
    .lbhc__lede{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#2E2E31;max-width:70ch}
    .lbhc__lede-en{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#3A3A3C;max-width:70ch;direction:ltr;text-align:end}
    .lbhc__cats{list-style:none;margin:22px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px 10px}
    .lbhc__cat{display:block;color:#0B0B0C;text-decoration:none}
    .lbhc__cat-img{display:block;aspect-ratio:1;background:#EFECE5;border:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.16);overflow:hidden}
    .lbhc__cat-img img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .3s}
    .lbhc__cat-t{display:block;margin-top:7px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.35}
    .lbhc__cat-n{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3A3A3C}
    .lbhc__cat:hover .lbhc__cat-t,.lbhc__cat:focus-visible .lbhc__cat-t{color:#BF2E15}
    .lbhc__cat:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #BF2E15;outline-offset:3px}
    .lbhc__row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:20px 0 0}
    .lbhc__chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 15px;
      border:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.22);background:#fff;color:#0B0B0C;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;
      transition:background-color .18s,color .18s,border-color .18s}
    .lbhc__chip:hover,.lbhc__chip:focus-visible{background:#0B0B0C;color:#F4EFE6;border-color:#0B0B0C}
    .lbhc__chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #BF2E15;outline-offset:2px}
    .lbhc__n{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;opacity:.62;direction:ltr}
    @media(hover:hover){.lbhc__cat:hover .lbhc__cat-img img{transform:scale(1.04)}}
    /* phones: one swipe row each, so browsing options cost two lines of height, not ten */
    @media(max-width:759px){
      .lbhc__cats,.lbhc__row{display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain;scroll-snap-type:x proximity;
        margin-inline:calc(-1 * var(--pad,20px));padding-inline:var(--pad,20px);padding-bottom:4px;scrollbar-width:none}
      .lbhc__cats::-webkit-scrollbar,.lbhc__row::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
      .lbhc__cats > li{flex:0 0 30%;scroll-snap-align:start}
      .lbhc__chip{flex:none;scroll-snap-align:start}
    }
    @media(min-width:760px){.lbhc__cats{grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr))}}
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.lbhc__cat-img img,.lbhc__chip{transition:none}}
  </style>
  <div class="lbhc__in">
    <p class="lbhc__kick">WHAT WE SELL</p>
    <h2 id="lbhc-h">حوايج براند <span class="lbhc__lt" dir="ltr">second-hand</span> و <span class="lbhc__lt" dir="ltr">vintage</span> أصلية، مختارة وحدة بوحدة</h2>
    <p class="lbhc__lede">Lbass Original كيبيع حوايج براند مستعملة أصلية فالمغرب — صبابط، جاكيطات، تراك، تيشرتات وإكسسوارات. كل قطعة مصورة بصورها هي، الحالة والقياس مكتوبين قبل ما تطلب.</p>
    <p class="lbhc__lede-en">Curated second-hand and vintage branded clothing in Morocco — Nike, Adidas, jackets, sneakers, track pants and accessories. Every piece is photographed exactly as it is, with its condition and size stated before you order.</p>
    {%- if hc_tiles != blank -%}<ul class="lbhc__cats" aria-label="تسوّق حسب الفئة">{{ hc_tiles }}</ul>{%- endif -%}
    {%- if hc_chips != blank -%}<div class="lbhc__row" aria-label="تسوّق حسب البراند">{{ hc_chips }}</div>{%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
